{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1315.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"0c1baf7d592efa7b2add1f8e9f9cf11ae29acf37c64274e78f9d36ce244adf61","ja":"迫真の演技","zh":"逼真的演技","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1315.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6e0e8387d7ba29cc9eb5f607e374d5ef313cf4dd8a214bea16c6f5979d9da517","ja":"やっと休憩ね。このあとは歌の収録だから、\n今のうちに体を休めておきましょ。","zh":"总算能休息了呢。之后还要录歌，\n趁现在好好放松一下身体吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1315.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"6ecbb8af2853e38a4ab964e75e72cb4608d7bf8af534c1a4a130a74b6919cd18","ja":"次で収録が終わりだよね？　この休憩時間の間に、\nこのみさんにドッキリかけなきゃ……。","zh":"下次录制就结束了吧？得趁着这段休息时间，\n对木实姐搞个整蛊才行……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1315.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1b2f12675b7722b47780b38b393d2d577e277de5d5beae7377750a42937cf907","ja":"うん。と、とにかく、やるだけやってみる……。","zh":"嗯。总、总之，先尽力试试看……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1315.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4c08f112a77af4c65318dad3892b90baff3a370724b4bc0d3d91a2097a1987e5","ja":"どうしたの？　ふたりともこそこそして。\nお姉さんには秘密のお話かしら？","zh":"怎么了？两个人鬼鬼祟祟的。\n难道是对大姐姐保密的话题吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1315.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"2d65d87107ff0194ab454a8485bd57529ac1af0b2a8e419dd9d5636e28cf45d6","ja":"べ、別にこそこそなんてしてないよ。\nちょっと、ドッキリの相談を……あっ！？","zh":"才、才没有偷偷摸摸的呢。\n只是在商量整蛊的事……啊！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1315.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"b4bd26d8e3d9a9fc3f5527c5feb50948846ca8d008babc4ccf003fc1858325b6","ja":"えっ、なになに？　ドッキリって……。","zh":"诶，什么什么？整蛊是指……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1315.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"4320a278edd18e53bdbd96e607aa81f2ea8c8c9474575ba87e9cd1143a0a71b8","ja":"あっ……あぁぁぁぁ！　やだ、だめっ！　\nこっちに来ないで、いやぁぁぁっ！","zh":"啊……啊啊啊啊！不要，不行！\n别过来，不要啊啊啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1315.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"06636bafc672afdca8d75fd71dbae8c2cbc942303e72714eff186d9e6b5ef6f4","ja":"えっ！　桃子ちゃん、どうしたの！？\n体も震えて……なにかあったの！？","zh":"咦！　小桃子，怎么了吗！？\n身体还在发抖……发生什么事了吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1315.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"64d8f40eaf879134bb7ecaa50fd0f2c790f73efa510bdd5c5d611756b4050ec6","ja":"あっ！　桃子ちゃん、大丈夫！？\nねえ、桃子ちゃん！　桃子ちゃん！","zh":"啊！桃子，你没事吧！？\n喂，桃子！桃子！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1315.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"c06f28e93ea3f8b32147eba93d8fdcc648f50cb622cba62db547d18802a5e5f3","ja":"あぁぁ……桃子？　わたしはサエ……。\nかつて、あの村で生贄にされたもの……。","zh":"啊啊……桃子？我是纱江……。\n曾经在那个村子里沦为祭品的人……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1315.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"907ab3f46a3c04a7035e923111f44ae63d93a91db2de37c195831c58711733e0","ja":"そういえば、ろけ地でこのような噂を耳にしました。\n昔、あの村で生贄となったサエという娘がおり……。","zh":"说起来，在拍摄地听到了这样的传闻。\n从前，那个村庄里有个叫纱枝的姑娘成了祭品……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1315.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"82db7f879cd4446d0136748a09a7b885d25c5c5b403b364a04e7a0b9adfdad58","ja":"夜な夜な幽霊となって、このみに似た小柄な\nお姉さんを探し歩いていると……ですよね、瑞希。","zh":"每晚都会化作幽灵，四处寻找长得像\n木实的小个子大姐姐……是吧，瑞希。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1315.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"d2305d7e8016083b45cb6c0ed5766dde9d0e969080407e10a27d7c7cd7caefda","ja":"あっ……は、はい。周防さんに怨霊が取り憑いたのは、\n馬場さんを頼っているからです。……きっとそうだぞ。","zh":"啊……是、是的。怨灵之所以会附在周防身上，\n是因为在依赖马场小姐。……肯定是这样没错。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1315.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"f9f275e4e390a0dce73fba8ecebd468e611e0afd2737a2f66ca8cc3f5cf43c3b","ja":"お姉ちゃん……どうして、あのとき……\nわたしをかばってくれなかったのぉぉぉぉ！","zh":"姐姐……为什么，那个时候……\n没有护着我啊啊啊啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1315.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"623f0dee62ae279c2dd179ed86b03c39d4d92b79e10b2801fb7f1294cb662ec0","ja":"ち、違う……それ、私じゃない！\nえ、やだ、お願い、こっちに来ないで！","zh":"不、不是的……那、那不是我！\n咦，不要，求求你，别过来！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1315.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"0b2a94a3a823dcd218f6fdba160819e4cc9f125be7254a4b14631eb9ca9f6b1c","ja":"えっとえっと……こうなったら、このみさんが\n桃子ちゃんの除霊をするしかないよ！","zh":"那个那个……事到如今，就只能由木实姐\n来帮桃子驱灵了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1315.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"35d6583837167ba98d548e73d9056ee60384b5179a6ec5059cb416f1a42a9f3c","ja":"ええっ！？　わ、私、怨霊とかホラーは\nダメで……うう、どうしたらいいの～！？","zh":"咦！？我、我对怨灵和恐怖题材\n完全不行的……呜呜，该怎么办才好啊～！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
